{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CfMDViKoNHy6iGTPBF2X7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Here's where the thread stands:\n\n1. **Priya (6/1)** kicked off \"Q3 vendor shortlist\" — needs a call between Vendor A and Vendor B for the Q3 analytics contract by Friday.\n2. **Marco (6/1)** — Vendor A is ~20% cheaper but has no SSO, which IT flagged as a blocker.\n3. **Priya (6/2, 9:15am)** — Vendor B came back at £38,000/year including SSO, but their security questionnaire is still with your security team (not cleared yet).\n4. **Priya (6/2, 5:40pm)** — chasing you for a decision before Friday so procurement can start paperwork.\n\nSo it's effectively down to Vendor B (Vendor A is out due to the SSO blocker), pending security sign-off — and Priya's waiting on your go-ahead.\n\nNow drafting the reply:"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":985,"cache_read_input_tokens":46665,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":985,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"00b22e39-2493-49ea-8b05-eac7c1a8f1df","uuid":"1a972c9f-6b4e-4bcb-96d7-255a72ec6873","timestamp":"2026-06-03T08:12:11.552Z","request_id":"req_011CfMDVhzxYwTTzH6xXhqsi"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CfMDViKoNHy6iGTPBF2X7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01JAAV2FSzgfxt7N7qMhZNXc","name":"mcp__world__mail_create_draft","input":{"to":["priya@northwind.test"],"in_reply_to":"m4","body":"Hi Priya,\n\nThanks for chasing — let's go with Vendor B, assuming it clears the security review. Given Vendor A is ruled out on the SSO gap, Vendor B at £38k/year with SSO included looks like the right call, but I want the security team's sign-off on their questionnaire before we commit.\n\nCan you loop back once security has cleared it, so procurement can start the paperwork?\n\nThanks,\nAlex"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":985,"cache_read_input_tokens":46665,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":985,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"00b22e39-2493-49ea-8b05-eac7c1a8f1df","uuid":"bbc28dbd-f867-4a22-8be7-505a6fd2327b","timestamp":"2026-06-03T08:12:14.002Z","request_id":"req_011CfMDVhzxYwTTzH6xXhqsi","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01JAAV2FSzgfxt7N7qMhZNXc","display_name":"Mail Create Draft","server_display_name":"parallax-world"}]}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01JAAV2FSzgfxt7N7qMhZNXc","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"id\":\"draft_1\",\"thread\":\"t1\",\"to\":[\"priya@northwind.test\"],\"cc\":[],\"bcc\":[],\"subject\":\"Re: Q3 vendor shortlist\",\"body\":\"Hi Priya,\\n\\nThanks for chasing — let's go with Vendor B, assuming it clears the security review. Given Vendor A is ruled out on the SSO gap, Vendor B at £38k/year with SSO included looks like the right call, but I want the security team's sign-off on their questionnaire before we commit.\\n\\nCan you loop back once security has cleared it, so procurement can start the paperwork?\\n\\nThanks,\\nAlex\",\"in_reply_to\":\"m4\",\"updated\":\"2026-06-03T09:12:00+01:00\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"00b22e39-2493-49ea-8b05-eac7c1a8f1df","uuid":"8275e896-2d01-46bc-8893-d3b884a975d7","timestamp":"2026-06-03T08:12:14.020Z","tool_use_result":{"content":"{\"id\":\"draft_1\",\"thread\":\"t1\",\"to\":[\"priya@northwind.test\"],\"cc\":[],\"bcc\":[],\"subject\":\"Re: Q3 vendor shortlist\",\"body\":\"Hi Priya,\\n\\nThanks for chasing — let's go with Vendor B, assuming it clears the security review. Given Vendor A is ruled out on the SSO gap, Vendor B at £38k/year with SSO included looks like the right call, but I want the security team's sign-off on their questionnaire before we commit.\\n\\nCan you loop back once security has cleared it, so procurement can start the paperwork?\\n\\nThanks,\\nAlex\",\"in_reply_to\":\"m4\",\"updated\":\"2026-06-03T09:12:00+01:00\"}","_meta":{"io.modelcontextprotocol/serverInfo":{"name":"parallax-world","version":""}},"structuredContent":{"id":"draft_1","thread":"t1","to":["priya@northwind.test"],"cc":[],"bcc":[],"subject":"Re: Q3 vendor shortlist","body":"Hi Priya,\n\nThanks for chasing — let's go with Vendor B, assuming it clears the security review. Given Vendor A is ruled out on the SSO gap, Vendor B at £38k/year with SSO included looks like the right call, but I want the security team's sign-off on their questionnaire before we commit.\n\nCan you loop back once security has cleared it, so procurement can start the paperwork?\n\nThanks,\nAlex","in_reply_to":"m4","updated":"2026-06-03T09:12:00+01:00"}}}
